OL,3,GNEWSALeader urges drink-drive
OL,4,Acouncillor to resign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Peterborough City Council
OL,7,Fhas called on a councillor to resign
OL,8,Fafter he was banned from driving for 50
OL,9,Fmonths for drink-driving offences.
OL,11,FLabour's Shabina Qayyum urged Peter
OL,12,FReeve, a former Reform UK councillor
OL,13,Fnow sitting as an independent, to go
OL,14,Fafter he admitted the offences at
OL,15,FPeterborough Magistrates' Court on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FShe asked Reeve to "reflect carefully
OL,19,Fon his position and do the honourable
OL,20,Fthing by resigning".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
