OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALeader urges drink-drive
OL,4,Acouncillor to resign
OL,5,
OL,6,FReeve, however, said the resignation
OL,7,Fcall was a "cheap political stunt",
OL,8,Fadding: "Whilst there is no excuse for
OL,9,Fbreaking the law... this is a reaction
OL,10,Fto grief following the death of my
OL,11,Ffather previously and, more recently,
OL,12,Fthe death of my mother."
